---
description: Backend ports, tenant boundaries, consent, inference budgets and production claims
globs: "crates/**/*.rs,services/**/*.rs,infra/**/*,packages/contracts/**/*"
alwaysApply: false
---
Before backend work, read `docs/backend/BACKEND_MASTER_PLAN.md` and ADR-0005.
- Domain pure; application depends on ports; infrastructure implements ports.
- Never accept self-declared tenant or consent as proof of authorization in production.
- Consent + revocation fail closed; no remote inference without explicit gate.
- Treat UI and model inputs as untrusted; deterministic policy authority.
- NO real user content in tests/logs. No tokens or provider keys in repositories.
- Tests must show denial and happy path; no stub endpoint marked production-ready.
- PR must report budget impact, model usage and permissions reviewed.

- Ownership de backend B1–B21: Claude/Devin/ChatGPT con ticket específico; Cursor se concentra en frontend y adapters OS dentro de `apps/`. Si una integración demanda tocar `crates/`, `services/` o contratos, solicitar issue y revisión del owner backend; no resolverlo editando silenciosamente el core.
